@startuml
title Filter Tasks by Criteria - Main Success Scenario

actor "Generic User" as User
participant Browser
participant Server
database "Persistence Model" as Persistence

User -> Browser : Input filter criteria\n(status, from, to, key words, createdBy)
User -> Browser : Click search icon
Browser -> Server : Send request with compiled filter parameters

Server -> Server : Validate request,\nignore empty parameters
Server -> Persistence : Query tasks matching all criteria
Persistence --> Server : Return matching tasks

Server -> Server : Render TaskView\n(task table + empty filter bar)
Server --> Browser : Respond with TaskView
Browser --> User : Display matching tasks

@enduml